            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DONNA2B"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good quick, easy recipe for bolognese. I have had better, but was short on time and had a craving recently, so tried this and was satisfied. Used veal instead of beef and had no harissa on hand so substituted with cayenne. Good flavor, would def make again in a pinch. Mascarpone is a must in this one!",
